+| Lifecycle and completion        | `packages/core/src/tasks/task-centric/lifecycle.ts`                                                 | Pure transition tables coexist with runtime orchestration assumptions                                             | Kernel command reducer and invariant checks                             |
+| Authority and human decisions   | `packages/core/src/tasks/task-centric/policy.ts`, `packages/core/src/tasks/plan-execution-grant.ts` | Approval and execution grant concepts have multiple transport and compatibility entry points                      | Kernel authority values plus one adapter parser                         |
